### favorites.rest — Favoritos sobre publicaciones
### Módulo: src/favorites/favorites.controller.ts (FavoritesModule)
### Todas las rutas requieren JWT (no exige cuenta verificada: marcar favoritos
### no mueve autos ni dinero).
###
### Elegí entorno con "Switch Environment" (local/production). Ver REST_CLIENT.md.
### Mantenimiento: si cambia este endpoint, actualizá este archivo en el mismo
### cambio (ver CLAUDE.md).

### ── Setup: owner con listing ACTIVE (ver auth.rest/listings.rest) ──────────

@ownerEmail = fav-owner-{{$timestamp}}@test.local
@renterEmail = fav-renter-{{$timestamp}}@test.local
@password = TestPass123!
@ownerCode = 000000
@renterCode = 000000

# @name ownerRegisterStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/start
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "email": "{{ownerEmail}}" }

### ⚠️ Copiá el código del owner de la consola del server antes de seguir.
# @name ownerRegisterComplete
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/complete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{ownerEmail}}",
  "code": "{{ownerCode}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "firstName": "Carla",
  "lastName": "Owner",
  "acceptedTerms": true,
  "dateOfBirth": "1992-07-15"
}

@ownerToken = {{ownerRegisterComplete.response.body.$.accessToken}}

# @name renterRegisterStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/start
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "email": "{{renterEmail}}" }

### ⚠️ Copiá el código del renter de la consola del server antes de seguir.
# @name renterRegisterComplete
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/complete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{renterEmail}}",
  "code": "{{renterCode}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "firstName": "Bruno",
  "lastName": "Renter",
  "acceptedTerms": true,
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-03-10"
}

@renterToken = {{renterRegisterComplete.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### El owner necesita cuenta VERIFIED para publicar (ver verification.rest).

# @name createVehicle
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{ "brand": "Toyota", "model": "Corolla", "year": 2021, "category": "SEDAN" }

@vehicleId = {{createVehicle.response.body.$.id}}

# @name createListing
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "title": "Toyota Corolla 2021",
  "description": "Auto full equipo, service al día, ideal para viajes largos.",
  "pricePerDay": 15000,
  "locationText": "Av. Corrientes 1234, CABA",
  "latitude": -34.6037,
  "longitude": -58.3816,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

@listingId = {{createListing.response.body.$.id}}

### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Marca el listing como favorito.
POST {{baseUrl}}/favorites
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

{
  "listingId": "{{listingId}}"
}

### 2. Lista los favoritos propios (con el detalle del listing).
GET {{baseUrl}}/favorites/me
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

### 3. Lista solo los ids favoritos (para marcar el corazón en el catálogo
### sin traer el detalle completo de cada listing).
GET {{baseUrl}}/favorites/me/ids
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

### 4. Saca el listing de favoritos.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/favorites/{{listingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}
